    "body": "SEKOLAH KEBANGSAAN BANDAWANG\nEMERGENCY DRILL RECORD\n\nDrill type: Civil Defence (Air Raid)\nDate: 3 September 2077\nTime to assembly point: 4 min 12 sec\nPupils accounted for: 318 / 318\n\nNotes: Year Three required prompting at the stairwell — the younger children stop to collect their bags, which we have now told them four times not to do. Recommend a repeat drill early next term.\n\nThe siren test was audible at the far field, which answers the question raised at the last staff meeting.\n\nTeacher-in-charge: Cikgu Zaleha\n\nRemarks: The pupils treated the exercise as a game and were disappointed when it ended.\n\nThis is preferable to the alternative.",
